  "guard": {
    "stored": [
      {
        "id": "comment/guard-1",
        "group": "comment",
        "markdown": "The census reads every stored text through Dispatch's own API, and the guard refuses a file of this repository that holds one of those paragraphs back again.\n\nShort.\n"
      },
      {
        "id": "version/guard-2/1",
        "group": "document-version",
        "markdown": "A second stored paragraph, long enough that a file repeating it word for word can only have copied it out of what the census read from production.\n"
      }
    ],
    "holds": "# A finding\n\nSomething went wrong, and the evidence is this: A second stored paragraph, long enough that a file repeating it word for word can only have copied it out of what the census read from production.\n\nThat is all.\n",
    "clean": "# A finding\n\nSomething went wrong. The census read every stored text and put each in a class, and this file quotes none of them.\n"
  }
